{"translation":{"id":"pan_irv","name":"ਇੰਡਿਅਨ ਰਿਵਾਇਜ਼ਡ ਵਰਜ਼ਨ (IRV) - ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Punjabi Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"pan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"7bcf70d369a169a12ac867ce44def25b36147b72029339f8c8d3c7a06bab588d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31104,"languageName":"ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","languageEnglishName":"Punjabi"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"pan_irv","name":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","commonName":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","title":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8a1b7c5c3025a80671b87659256d14a42fb58ace987b687a83db2b26ac8a5d95","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":149,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ਇਸਰਾਏਲ ਪਰਮੇਸ਼ੁਰ ਦੀ ਉਸਤਤ ਕਰੇ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ਹਲਲੂਯਾਹ!","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਲਈ ਇੱਕ ਨਵਾਂ ਗੀਤ ਗਾਓ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਸੰਤਾਂ ਦੀ ਸਭਾ ਵਿੱਚ ਉਹ ਦੀ ਉਸਤਤ ਕਰੋ!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਇਸਰਾਏਲ ਆਪਣੇ ਕਰਤਾ ਵਿੱਚ ਅਨੰਦ ਹੋਵੇ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਸੀਯੋਨ ਦੇ ਵਾਸੀ ਆਪਣੇ ਪਾਤਸ਼ਾਹ ਵਿੱਚ ਬਾਗ-ਬਾਗ ਹੋਣ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਓਹ ਨੱਚਦੇ ਹੋਏ ਉਹ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਦੀ ਉਸਤਤ ਕਰਨ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਤਬਲਾ ਤੇ ਸਿਤਾਰ ਵਜਾਉਂਦੇ ਹੋਏ ਉਹ ਦਾ ਭਜਨ ਗਾਉਣ!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਆਪਣੀ ਪਰਜਾ ਨਾਲ ਖੁਸ਼ ਜੋ ਹੈ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਉਹ ਮਸਕੀਨਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਫ਼ਤਹ ਨਾਲ ਸਿੰਗਾਰੇਗਾ,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਸੰਤ","poem":1},{"noteId":75},{"text":"ਮਹਿਮਾ","poem":1},{"noteId":76},{"text":"ਵਿੱਚ ਬਾਗ-ਬਾਗ ਹੋਣ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਓਹ ਆਪਣੇ ਵਿਛਾਉਣਿਆਂ ਉੱਤੇ ਜੈਕਾਰਾ ਗਜਾਉਣ!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਪਰਮੇਸ਼ੁਰ ਦੀਆਂ ਵਡਿਆਈਆਂ ਉਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਦੇ ਕੰਨ ਵਿੱਚ ਹੋਣ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਉਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਦੇ ਹੱਥ ਵਿੱਚ ਦੋਧਾਰੀ ਤਲਵਾਰ,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਕਿ ਪਰਾਈਆਂ ਕੌਮਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਬਦਲਾ ਲੈਣ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਉੱਮਤਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਝਿੜਕੀਂ ਦੇਣ,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਉਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਦੇ ਰਾਜਿਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਸੰਗਲਾਂ ਦੇ ਨਾਲ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਤੇ ਉਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਦੇ ਪਤਵੰਤਿਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਲੋਹੇ ਦੀਆਂ ਬੇੜੀਆਂ ਨਾਲ ਬੰਨ੍ਹਣ,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਲਿਖੇ ਹੋਏ ਫ਼ਤਵੇ ਉਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਉੱਤੇ ਚਲਾਉਣ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"- ਇਹ ਉਹ ਦੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਸੰਤਾਂ ਦਾ ਮਾਣ ਹੈ।","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਹਲਲੂਯਾਹ!","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":75,"caller":"+","text":"ਪਵਿੱਤਰ ਲੋਕ","reference":{"chapter":149,"verse":5}},{"noteId":76,"caller":"+","text":"ਜਿੱਤ","reference":{"chapter":149,"verse":5}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/149.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/150.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/148.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}